// HALLOWEEN: the ghost hunt's pictures from OBL-Audio-lab (public/assets), scaled down and embedded as PNG data: the plain
// ghost from the front, back and side (facing left), the general's five views (its side facing left, its quarters facing
// screen left and right), the drops (the shield, the ice shard, the health banana, double points), and the monkey
// sidearm from the front (its drop), the side (facing left) and the back; and the elixir on the totems, EntropyLab's
// logo (the maintainer's entropylab-darkmode.png, 112 x 168). ghost-models.js tints and mirrors them into the sprites
// the hunt draws.
